6. Money Train (1995) - Finally, if you're in the mood for a darkly comedic crime caper, Money Train might hit the spot. Starring Wesley Snipes, Woody Harrelson, and Jennifer Lopez, this movie follows three individuals caught up in a dangerous scheme involving a train heist gone wrong. With its sharp dialogue and tense atmosphere, Money Train is a wild ride from start to finish.

